      "subject": "מה לך ולשלום",
      "rationale": "Mokgwa wa Seheberu 'go wena le kagiso go na le eng?' — go gana botšišo; phetolelo ya pelo-tekano ke 'o tseba eng ka kagiso?'."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "המלאך",
      "rationale": "Mo temaneng ye lentšu le bolela moromagedi wa kgoši, e sego mangeloi a Modimo."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Gomme mogogi wa pitšê a ya go mo ralala, a re: Mokgoši o re jaana: A go na le kagiso? Gomme Yehu a re: Eng go wena le kagiso? Botla go ba ka morago ga ka. Gomme mohlokomedi a tsebiša, a re: Moromagedi o fihlile go fihla go bona, mme ga a boa.",
